      "created_at": "2014-08-30T20:07:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The scenarios in the Baron Blade book say \"when Baron Blade incapacitates a hero\" blah blah blah happens.&nbsp;</p><p>If a hero is incapped by friendly fire, does that count?</p><p>Say Wraith is at 1 health. Bunker pings her with a Flak cannon to prevent Blade from getting an easy kill and a bonus whatever. That legal?</p>",
