      "raw": "<p>Since Baron Blade is the one who needs to do the incap, heroes incapping eachother would not give Baron Blade the Scenario Bonus. But remember, The Wraith still rolls her defense and it is entirely possible she would block of Bunker&#39;s attack dice.</p>",
