    {
      "id": 116740,
      "name": "peterrecore",
      "username": "peterrecore",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-31T05:11:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>But remember, The Wraith still rolls her defense and it is entirely possible she would block of Bunker's attack dice.</span></p></blockquote><p>Does that mean blocking optimally is required? &nbsp;The rules (page 9) say \"The defender <strong>*may*</strong> assign each defense die to block an attack die...\" &nbsp;I interpret this as explicitly giving the defender a choice of whether to block or not. &nbsp;As in the case mentioned above, it can be strategically sound to not block, on occasion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have a followup question though - since the scenario does specify that Blade has to the incapping in order to reap the bonus, does that mean Blade himself needs to do it, or will I get a bonus if my turret does the incapping?</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
