      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-31T19:08:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some scenarios state that a hero incap results in whatever, others specify it has to be the villain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can always rule friendly fire incaps to count the same to prevent shenanigans, but it isn't against the rules right now.</p>",
